        "template": "周期函数的傅里叶系数计算",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "$a_0$ 系数计算",
          "steps": [
            "由傅里叶系数公式：$a_0=\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}f(t)dt$",
            "因为 $f(t)=|t|$ 是偶函数：",
            "$a_0=\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}|t|dt=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\pi}t dt$",
            "$=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\frac{t^2}{2}\\right]_0^{\\pi}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}=\\pi$"
          ]
        }
      ],
