        "template": "傅里叶级数收敛性分析",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "误差平方积分估计",
          "steps": [
            "$g(t)=\\pi-t$ ($0\\leq t\\leq 2\\pi$) 是线性函数",
            "计算 $\\int_0^{2\\pi}g(t)^2dt=\\int_0^{2\\pi}(\\pi-t)^2dt$",
            "令 $u=\\pi-t$，则：",
            "$\\int_0^{2\\pi}(\\pi-t)^2dt=\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}u^2(-du)=\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}u^2du=\\frac{2\\pi^3}{3}$",
            "该函数的傅里叶系数为：$b_n=\\frac{2}{n}$（$n\\geq 1$），$a_0=\\pi$",
            "根据Parseval恒等式：",
            "$\\int_0^{2\\pi}g(t)^2dt=\\pi\\left[\\frac{a_0^2}{2}+\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}b_n^2\\right]=\\pi\\left[\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}+\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{4}{n^2}\\right]$",
            "误差：",
            "$I_{10}=\\pi\\sum_{n=11}^{\\infty}\\frac{4}{n^2}\\approx 4\\pi\\left[\\sum_{n=11}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n^2}\\right]\\approx 4\\pi\\cdot 0.0088 \\approx 0.11$"
          ]
        }
      ],
